cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VineWatch in field work or teaching, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "VineWatch: offline-first grape phenology (BBCH) field notebook PWA"
abstract: >-
  VineWatch is a static, offline-first progressive web app for recording
  grapevine phenology by plot using a trimmed set of 23 BBCH key stages,
  optional GPS coordinates, client-side compressed photos, and notes.
  All records stay in the browser's IndexedDB; data can be exported as
  UTF-8 BOM CSV, GeoJSON points, or a JSON backup.
authors:
